{
  "description": "std-pricing — side-by-side plan cards from a config list: plan name, price and billing period, a one-line summary, the included features, and a link action per plan; one plan can be highlighted as recommended with a badge. Optional heading and footnote. Clicking a plan's action follows its href and emits PLAN_SELECTED. Pick for pricing pages, subscription tiers and service packages.",
